       PROCESS APOST
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COBINFOSRV.
       AUTHOR.     BOB.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 2025.
      *==============================================================
      * COBINFOSRV - ILE COBOL Service Program: COBOL Reference Data
      *
      * Exported ILE procedure symbol: COBINFOSRV  (the PROGRAM-ID)
      * In ILE COBOL, only the PROGRAM-ID of the outermost program in
      * a compilation unit is exported as an ILE procedure symbol.
      * Paragraph names are internal to the COBOL module and cannot
      * be used as ILE export symbols.
      *
      * Interface contract (BY REFERENCE group item WS-TOPIC):
      *   WS-TOPIC-COUNT   PIC 9(3) COMP-4   - number of entries filled
      *   WS-ENTRY(1..120) PIC X(77)          - each entry is:
      *       first 27 chars: example / verb name
      *       last  50 chars: description
      *
      * Compile:   CRTCBLMOD MODULE(lib/COBINFOSRV)
      *                      SRCSTMF('path/cobinfosrv.cblle')
      *                      DBGVIEW(*SOURCE) OPTION(*APOST) AUT(*EXCLUDE)
      * Bind:      CRTSRVPGM SRVPGM(lib/COBINFOSRV)
      *                      MODULE(lib/COBINFOSRV)
      *                      EXPORT(*SRCFILE)
      *                      SRCSTMF('path/cobinfobd.bnd')
      *                      ACTGRP(*CALLER) AUT(*EXCLUDE)
      *==============================================================

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-I.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-I.

       DATA DIVISION.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      * WORKING-STORAGE - load helper, private to this module.
      * WS-LOAD combines a 27-char example and 50-char description
      * into one 77-char item, then MOVEd into the caller's array.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LOAD.
           05  WS-EX              PIC X(27).
           05  WS-DC              PIC X(50).

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      * LINKAGE SECTION - group item passed BY REFERENCE from the
      * calling program (COBOLINFO).  Caller owns the storage;
      * this program fills it.  Caller must declare identical layout.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOPIC.
           05  WS-TOPIC-COUNT     PIC 9(3)  COMP-4.
           05  WS-ENTRY           PIC X(77)
               OCCURS 120 TIMES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY REFERENCE WS-TOPIC.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 60 TO WS-TOPIC-COUNT

      *-- Alphabetic (A) --
           MOVE '--- Alphabetic (A) ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(1)
           MOVE 'PIC A(10)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Letters and spaces only.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(2)
           MOVE 'PIC A(2)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'State code: letters and spaces only.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(3)

      *-- Alphanumeric (X) --
           MOVE '--- Alphanumeric (X) ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(4)
           MOVE 'PIC X(30)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Any characters: letters, digits, symbols.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(5)
           MOVE 'PIC X(1)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Single character flag or code field.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(6)
           MOVE 'PIC X(80)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Full-width screen line buffer field.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(7)

      *-- Unsigned numeric (9) --
           MOVE '--- Unsigned Numeric (9) ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(8)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(5)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Unsigned integer: 00000 to 99999.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(9)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(9)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Unsigned integer up to 999999999.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(10)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(7)V99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Unsigned: 7 integer, 2 decimal places.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(11)
           MOVE 'PIC 99V9' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Short form: 2 integer, 1 decimal place.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(12)

      *-- Signed numeric (S9) --
           MOVE '--- Signed Numeric (S9) ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(13)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(5)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Signed integer: -99999 to +99999.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(14)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(9)V99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Signed: 9 integer + 2 decimal places.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(15)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Packed decimal; efficient arithmetic.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(16)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(9) COMP-4' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Binary integer; good for counters.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(17)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(9) BINARY' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'BINARY is a synonym for COMP-4.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(18)

      *-- Implied decimal (V) --
           MOVE '--- Implied Decimal (V) ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(19)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(5)V9(2)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'V marks decimal; not stored in the field.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(20)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(7)V9(4)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Signed; 7 integer, 4 decimal places.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(21)

      *-- Scaling (P) --
           MOVE '--- Scaling Factor (P) ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(22)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(3)PPP' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Scales by 1000: stored value is nnn000.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(23)
           MOVE 'PIC PPP9(3)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Scales by .001: stored value is .000nnn.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(24)

      *-- COMP-1 / COMP-2 floating point --
           MOVE '--- Float (COMP-1 / COMP-2)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(25)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(6)V9 COMP-1' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Single-precision float (4 bytes on IBM i).'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(26)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(16)V9(7) COMP-2' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Double-precision float (8 bytes on IBM i).'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(27)

      *-- COMP-5 native binary --
           MOVE '--- Native Binary (COMP-5) -' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(28)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(4) COMP-5' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Native binary; no digit-count truncation.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(29)
           MOVE 'PIC S9(9) COMP-5' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Full 4-byte native integer value.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(30)

      *-- Edited: zero suppression (Z) --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Zero Suppress --' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(31)
           MOVE 'PIC ZZZZ9' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Suppress leading zeros; last digit always shown.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(32)
           MOVE 'PIC Z(6)9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Suppress leading zeros with decimal point.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(33)

      *-- Edited: asterisk fill (*) --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Asterisk Fill --' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(34)
           MOVE 'PIC ***9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Fill leading positions with asterisks.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(35)
           MOVE 'PIC *(6)9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Check-protect: asterisk fill shorthand.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(36)

      *-- Edited: fixed dollar sign ($) --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Fixed Dollar ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(37)
           MOVE 'PIC $ZZZ,ZZ9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Fixed $ with zero suppression and comma.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(38)
           MOVE 'PIC $9(7).99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Fixed $ sign: always printed in output.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(39)

      *-- Edited: floating dollar sign ($$) --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Floating Dollar ' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(40)
           MOVE 'PIC $$(6)9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Dollar sign floats next to first digit.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(41)

      *-- Edited: sign symbols --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Sign Symbols ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(42)
           MOVE 'PIC +ZZZ9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Leading +/-: displays sign of value.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(43)
           MOVE 'PIC ZZZ9.99-' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Trailing minus: shows - only if negative.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(44)
           MOVE 'PIC ZZZ9.99+' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Trailing +/-: shows + or - always.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(45)
           MOVE 'PIC Z(7).99CR' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Trailing CR if negative, spaces if positive.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(46)
           MOVE 'PIC Z(7).99DB' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Trailing DB if negative, spaces if positive.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(47)

      *-- Edited: comma and period --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Comma / Period -' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(48)
           MOVE 'PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Comma grouping separator; period for decimal.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(49)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(6),9(3).99' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Explicit comma inserted in picture string.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(50)

      *-- Edited: slash and blank (B) --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Slash / Blank --' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(51)
           MOVE 'PIC 99/99/9999' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Slash inserts / in output for date display.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(52)
           MOVE 'PIC 9(4)B9(2)B9(2)' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'B inserts a blank space in output position.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(53)

      *-- Edited: zero insertion (0) --
           MOVE '--- Edited: Zero Insertion -' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(54)
           MOVE 'PIC 999099' TO WS-EX
           MOVE '0 inserts a literal zero digit in output.'
               TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(55)

      *-- Level 66 RENAMES --
           MOVE '--- Level 66 RENAMES ------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(56)
           MOVE '66 NEWNAME RENAMES OLDNAME' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Alias for a range of existing fields.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(57)

      *-- Level 88 condition names --
           MOVE '--- Level 88 Conditions ---' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(58)
           MOVE '88 FLAG-ON VALUE ''Y''' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Condition name: true when field = Y.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(59)
           MOVE '88 IS-DONE VALUE ''Y'' ''D''' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Multiple values for one condition name.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(60)

           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM COBINFOSRV.

      *==============================================================
      * COBVERBS - ILE COBOL Service Program: COBOL Verb Reference
      *
      * Exported ILE procedure symbol: COBVERBS  (the PROGRAM-ID)
      *
      * Interface contract (BY REFERENCE group item WS-TOPIC):
      *   WS-TOPIC-COUNT   PIC 9(3) COMP-4   - number of entries filled
      *   WS-ENTRY(1..120) PIC X(77)          - each entry is:
      *       first 27 chars: verb name / indented example
      *       last  50 chars: description / usage note
      *
      * Entry layout uses two-line pairs per verb:
      *   Line 1: WS-EX = verb name, WS-DC = short description
      *   Line 2: WS-EX = indented example, WS-DC = usage note
      *==============================================================
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COBVERBS.
       AUTHOR.     BOB.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 2025.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-I.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-I.

       DATA DIVISION.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      * WORKING-STORAGE - load helper, private to this module.
      * WS-LOAD combines a 27-char example and 50-char description
      * into one 77-char item, then MOVEd into the caller's array.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LOAD.
           05  WS-EX              PIC X(27).
           05  WS-DC              PIC X(50).

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      * LINKAGE SECTION - group item passed BY REFERENCE from the
      * calling program (COBOLINFO).  Caller owns the storage;
      * this program fills it.  Caller must declare identical layout.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOPIC.
           05  WS-TOPIC-COUNT     PIC 9(3)  COMP-4.
           05  WS-ENTRY           PIC X(77)
               OCCURS 120 TIMES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY REFERENCE WS-TOPIC.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 114 TO WS-TOPIC-COUNT

      *-- Data Movement --
           MOVE '--- Data Movement ----------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(1)
           MOVE 'MOVE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Copy a value to a receiving field.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(2)
           MOVE '  MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-DEST' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Source/dest types must be compatible.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(3)
           MOVE 'INITIALIZE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Set data items to default values.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(4)
           MOVE '  INITIALIZE WS-RECORD' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Numerics 0; alphanumerics spaces.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(5)
           MOVE 'SET' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Assign index, pointer, or 88-level.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(6)
           MOVE '  SET WS-IDX TO 1' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Also: SET cond-name TO TRUE.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(7)
           MOVE 'STRING' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Concatenate strings into one field.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(8)
           MOVE '  STRING A DELIMITED SIZE IN' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'POINTER tracks position in target.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(9)
           MOVE 'UNSTRING' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Split a string into multiple fields.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(10)
           MOVE '  UNSTRING B DELIM '','' INTO' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'TALLYING counts substrings found.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(11)

      *-- Arithmetic --
           MOVE '--- Arithmetic --------------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(12)
           MOVE 'ADD' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Add one or more values together.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(13)
           MOVE '  ADD TAX TO TOTAL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'ON SIZE ERROR catches overflow.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(14)
           MOVE 'SUBTRACT' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Subtract values from a receiving field.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(15)
           MOVE '  SUBTRACT DISC FROM PRICE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'GIVING stores result in separate item.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(16)
           MOVE 'MULTIPLY' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Multiply two values.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(17)
           MOVE '  MULTIPLY QTY BY PRICE GIVE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Use ROUNDED to round the result.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(18)
           MOVE 'DIVIDE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Divide; optionally keep remainder.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(19)
           MOVE '  DIVIDE TOT BY CNT GIVING A' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'REMAINDER clause captures the modulus.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(20)
           MOVE 'COMPUTE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Evaluate an arithmetic expression.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(21)
           MOVE '  COMPUTE NET=GROSS-GROSS*TX' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Supports +, -, *, /, ** (power).' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(22)

      *-- Control Flow --
           MOVE '--- Control Flow ------------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(23)
           MOVE 'PERFORM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Execute a paragraph or inline loop.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(24)
           MOVE '  PERFORM P UNTIL FLAG=''Y''' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'VARYING and TIMES forms also valid.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(25)
           MOVE 'IF / ELSE / END-IF' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Conditional branch on a boolean test.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(26)
           MOVE '  IF AMT>0...ELSE...END-IF' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Nest IFs freely; always use END-IF.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(27)
           MOVE 'EVALUATE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Multi-way branch; replaces nested IFs.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(28)
           MOVE '  EVALUATE CODE WHEN X...OTH' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'EVALUATE TRUE...WHEN cond is valid.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(29)
           MOVE 'GO TO' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Unconditional branch to a paragraph.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(30)
           MOVE '  GO TO END-PARA' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Prefer PERFORM or EVALUATE instead.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(31)
           MOVE 'STOP RUN' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'End execution and return to caller.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(32)
           MOVE '  STOP RUN' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Ends the activation group (ILE).' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(33)

      *-- Input/Output --
           MOVE '--- Input / Output ----------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(34)
           MOVE 'OPEN' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Open a file before reading or writing.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(35)
           MOVE '  OPEN INPUT CUSTOMER-FILE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Modes: INPUT OUTPUT I-O EXTEND.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(36)
           MOVE 'CLOSE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Close a file when processing is done.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(37)
           MOVE '  CLOSE CUSTOMER-FILE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Always close files before GOBACK.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(38)
           MOVE 'READ' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Read next or keyed record from file.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(39)
           MOVE '  READ F NEXT AT END MOVE Y' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Use KEY IS for random keyed access.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(40)
           MOVE 'WRITE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Write a new record to a file.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(41)
           MOVE '  WRITE REC INVK PERFORM ERR' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'BEFORE/AFTER ADVANCING for printers.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(42)
           MOVE 'REWRITE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Update an existing record in-place.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(43)
           MOVE '  REWRITE REC INVK KEY PRFRM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'File open I-O; record must exist.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(44)
           MOVE 'DELETE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Remove a record from an indexed file.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(45)
           MOVE '  DELETE CUST-FILE RECORD' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Must have been read in dynamic mode.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(46)

      *-- Table Handling --
           MOVE '--- Table Handling ----------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(47)
           MOVE 'SEARCH' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Serial search of a table (OCCURS).' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(48)
           MOVE '  SEARCH TBL AT END WHEN...' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Index incremented automatically.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(49)
           MOVE 'SEARCH ALL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Binary search; requires sorted table.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(50)
           MOVE '  SEARCH ALL TBL WHEN K=VAL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Table sorted on ASCENDING/DESCENDING KEY.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(51)
           MOVE 'SORT' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Sort records in a file or table.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(52)
           MOVE '  SORT SF ASCENDING KEY FLD' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'INPUT/OUTPUT PROCEDURE for custom logic.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(53)
           MOVE 'MERGE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Merge two or more sorted files.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(54)
           MOVE '  MERGE MF ASCENDING KEY FLD' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Requires OUTPUT PROCEDURE or GIVING.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(55)

      *-- Program Linkage --
           MOVE '--- Program Linkage ---------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(56)
           MOVE 'CALL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Transfer control to another program.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(57)
           MOVE '  CALL ''P'' USING BY REF PARM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'BY VALUE copies; BY REF shares storage.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(58)
           MOVE 'CANCEL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Release storage of a called program.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(59)
           MOVE '  CANCEL ''PROGNAME''' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Next CALL re-initializes the program.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(60)
           MOVE 'GOBACK' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Return to immediate caller.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(61)
           MOVE '  GOBACK' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Preferred over STOP RUN in ILE.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(62)
           MOVE 'EXIT PROGRAM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Return from a called COBOL subprogram.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(63)
           MOVE '  EXIT PROGRAM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'No-op in main program; use GOBACK.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(64)

      *-- Exception / Debug --
           MOVE '--- Exception / Debug -------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(65)
           MOVE 'INSPECT' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Scan/count/replace chars in a field.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(66)
           MOVE '  INSPECT F TALLYING FOR ALL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'CONVERTING replaces sets of chars.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(67)
           MOVE 'ON EXCEPTION' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Handle error on a CALL statement.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(68)
           MOVE '  CALL ''P'' ON EXCEPTION PERF' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Fires when called pgm not found.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(69)
           MOVE 'ON SIZE ERROR' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Catch arithmetic overflow or div/0.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(70)
           MOVE '  COMPUTE X=A/B ON SZE ERR' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Also: ADD SUBTRACT MULTIPLY DIVIDE.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(71)
           MOVE 'DISPLAY' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Write to job log or system console.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(72)
           MOVE '  DISPLAY ''Val: '' WS-AMOUNT' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Outputs to QSYSOPR/job log.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(73)

      *-- String Handling --
           MOVE '--- String Handling ---------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(74)
           MOVE 'MOVE SPACES' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Clear an alphanumeric field to spaces.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(75)
           MOVE '  MOVE SPACES TO WS-NAME' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Like INITIALIZE for alpha-only items.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(76)
           MOVE 'MOVE ZEROS' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Set a numeric field to zero.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(77)
           MOVE '  MOVE ZEROS TO WS-COUNTER' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'ZEROES and ZERO are synonyms.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(78)
           MOVE 'MOVE CORRESPONDING' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Copy matching-name fields between groups.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(79)
           MOVE '  MOVE CORR SRC TO DST-GROUP' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Only same-named fields are moved.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(80)

      *-- Scope Terminators --
           MOVE '--- Scope Terminators -------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(81)
           MOVE 'END-IF' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate an IF statement explicitly.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(82)
           MOVE '  IF X > 0 PERFORM A END-IF' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Preferred over period-termination.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(83)
           MOVE 'END-EVALUATE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate an EVALUATE statement.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(84)
           MOVE '  EVALUATE TRUE WHEN END-EV' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Required in nested EVALUATE blocks.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(85)
           MOVE 'END-PERFORM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate an inline PERFORM loop.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(86)
           MOVE '  PERFORM UNTIL END-PERFORM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Body between PERFORM and END-PERFORM.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(87)
           MOVE 'END-READ' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate a READ statement.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(88)
           MOVE '  READ F AT END NOT AT END' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Allows AT END and NOT AT END.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(89)
           MOVE 'END-WRITE / END-REWRITE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate WRITE or REWRITE statement.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(90)
           MOVE '  WRITE REC INVK END-WRITE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Pattern: END-DELETE, END-SEARCH.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(91)
           MOVE 'END-CALL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate a CALL statement.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(92)
           MOVE '  CALL ''P'' EXCPTN END-CALL' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Required when ON EXCEPTION is used.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(93)
           MOVE 'END-COMPUTE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate a COMPUTE statement.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(94)
           MOVE '  COMPUTE X=A+B SZE ERR EC' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Required when ON SIZE ERROR is used.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(95)
           MOVE 'END-STRING / END-UNSTRING' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Terminate STRING or UNSTRING.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(96)
           MOVE '  STRING A DELIMITED SIZE IN' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Required when ON OVERFLOW is used.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(97)

      *-- Miscellaneous --
           MOVE '--- Miscellaneous -----------' TO WS-EX
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(98)
           MOVE 'ACCEPT' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Receive data from environment or user.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(99)
           MOVE '  ACCEPT WS-DATE FROM DATE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'FROM DATE YYYYMMDD for 4-digit year.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(100)
           MOVE 'CONTINUE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'No-op placeholder in logic flow.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(101)
           MOVE '  WHEN OTHER CONTINUE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Explicit do-nothing branch.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(102)
           MOVE 'NEXT SENTENCE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Branch to next sentence (period).' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(103)
           MOVE '  IF X = 0 NEXT SENTENCE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Use CONTINUE in new code instead.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(104)
           MOVE 'ENTRY' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Alternate entry point in a program.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(105)
           MOVE '  ENTRY ''ALT'' USING LK-PARM' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Caller enters at the named label.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(106)
           MOVE 'ALTER' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Modify a GO TO target at run time.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(107)
           MOVE '  ALTER PARA-A TO PROCEED TO' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Obsolete; avoid in new programs.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(108)
           MOVE 'RELEASE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Pass a record to the SORT facility.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(109)
           MOVE '  RELEASE SREC FROM WS-INREC' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Used in SORT INPUT PROCEDURE.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(110)
           MOVE 'RETURN' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Retrieve sorted record from SORT.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(111)
           MOVE '  RETURN SF INTO WS-OUT-REC' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Used in SORT OUTPUT PROCEDURE.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(112)
           MOVE 'OPEN EXTEND' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Open file to append records.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(113)
           MOVE '  OPEN EXTEND AUDIT-FILE' TO WS-EX
           MOVE 'Appends after last existing record.' TO WS-DC
           MOVE WS-LOAD TO WS-ENTRY(114)

           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM COBVERBS.
